tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["学習スタイルの証拠を評価したレビュー論文によると、「学習スタイルに合わせた指導」の有効性を証明するには、まずスタイル別に生徒をグループ分けし、次に各グループの生徒を異なる指導法にランダムに割り当て、最後に同一のテストで測定するという手順が必要です。有効な判断基準となるのは、特定の相互作用（あるスタイルに最も効果的な指導法が、別のスタイルには最も効果的ではないという現象）が現れることです。このレビューの結論は、そのような相互作用はほとんど見られないということです。学習スタイルに関する文献は数多く存在しますが、適切な実験デザインを用いた研究は極めて少なく、そのうちのいくつかは「マッチング仮説」と直接矛盾する結果を示しています。著者はこれに基づき、現在の証拠では学習スタイル診断を教育現場に導入することを支持するには不十分であると考えています。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Pashler H, McDaniel M, Rohrer D, Bjork R (2008). Learning Styles: Concepts and Evidence. Psychological Science in the Public Interest, 9(3), 105–119. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1539-6053.2009.01038.x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1539-6053.2009.01038.x"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1539-6053.2009.01038.x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["また、このレビューは、すべてのバージョンの学習スタイル理論が検証され否定されたわけではなく、多くはそもそも検証すらされていないことも説明しています。避けるべきなのは、「スタイル診断に費用をかけること」と「スタイルに合わせて研修講座を選ぶこと」の2点です。講座選びの基準については、第 9 条（研修は政府の補助金制度を優先）および第 13 条（即戦力となる短期プロジェクトを優先）を参照してください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/23-17"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"数種類の問題形式を混ぜて練習しよう。一種を20問連続で解くのは避けること"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/23-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"暗記すべき内容は、将来の使い方を想定して自分に問題を出してテストすること。単に丸暗記して終わりにしてはいけない"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/23-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["学んだらまず本を閉じ、自力でテストす